WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.610
Ask 17-year-olds in France
if they smoke every day.

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:07.610
In 2017, 25.1 per cent did.

3
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.340
In 2022: 15.6 per cent.

4
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.860
Same survey, same age, five years later.

5
00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.730
Some say «la prévention sauve des vies».

6
00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:21.130
Others reply: «Chaque adulte
doit rester libre de ses choix».

7
00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.530
So what changed for French teenagers,

8
00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.570
and which risks are still there?

9
00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:30.890
In this mission, you'll compare
17-year-olds in 2017 and 2022.

10
00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.160
Then you'll argue both sides:

11
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:35.810
should the state protect
people from themselves,

12
00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.720
even from their own choices?

13
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.260
Your mission: find out what changed,

14
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.720
and what risks remain.
